cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Promcast, please cite it as below.
title: "Promcast: forecasts for Prometheus metrics that fire alerts before a threshold is crossed"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jawad
    given-names: Intesar
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/intesarjawad/promcast"
abstract: >-
  Promcast reads series from a Prometheus-compatible TSDB, forecasts them and serves the
  forecasts back as metrics, so an alert can fire before a threshold is crossed.
keywords:
  - Prometheus
  - time series forecasting
  - alerting
  - observability
